@startuml
title System Startup — Arch Flow

actor "Admin\n(CLI)" as Admin
participant "Runner\n(AppRunner)" as Runner
participant "Config" as Config
participant "DB" as DB
participant "CAN Layer" as CAN
participant "Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "API" as API

== Startup sequence ==
Admin -> Runner : start(config_path)
Runner -> Config : load(system.json, alarms.json)
Runner -> Config : validate schema
Runner -> DB : init_db() + schema
Runner -> CAN : per-channel: load DB, init CANReader
Runner -> Pipeline : create + add stages
Runner -> API : create_app(config)
Runner -> Runner : asyncio.create_task(all)
Runner --> Admin : ready on :8000

note right of Runner
  VERIFIED AGAINST CURRENT SOURCE CODE
  All init steps correct & in order.
  Cold start target: ≤5s. Config validation: fail-fast.
  See SDD_sequence_boot_startup & SDD_DETAILED_VERIFICATION.md
end note

@enduml
